        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: UEA Creative Writing Course directors, Tim O'Brien\n- Organizations: UEA Creative Writing Course\n- Works: The Things They Carried\n- Roles: poet, novelist, author\n- Topics: Vietnam War literature\n\nFacts:\n- One of the Course Directors of the UEA Creative Writing Course is both a poet and a novelist.\n- Tim O'Brien is the author of The Things They Carried.\n- The Things They Carried is a collection of linked short stories.\n- The Things They Carried is about a platoon of American soldiers fighting on the ground in the Vietnam War.\n- The author of The Things They Carried is contrasted with the UEA Creative Writing Course director as not being both a poet and a novelist.",
